This product includes a Java port of read-path detectors from zxing-cpp
(https://github.com/zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp), tag v3.1.1:
the Data Matrix detector (core/src/datamatrix/DMDetector.cpp, including DetectOld,
core/src/WhiteRectDetector.cpp), the QR finder (core/src/qrcode/QRDetector.cpp, including the Micro QR sampler,
core/src/ConcentricFinder.cpp, core/src/GridSampler.cpp), the QR bit decoder for Micro QR and model 2
(core/src/qrcode/QRDecoder.cpp, core/src/qrcode/QRBitMatrixParser.cpp,
core/src/qrcode/QRFormatInformation.cpp, core/src/qrcode/QRVersion.cpp,
core/src/qrcode/QRDataBlock.cpp, core/src/qrcode/QRCodecMode.cpp,
core/src/qrcode/QRDataMask.h), the Data Matrix bit decoder
(core/src/datamatrix/DMDecoder.cpp, core/src/datamatrix/DMBitLayout.cpp,
core/src/datamatrix/DMDataBlock.cpp, core/src/datamatrix/DMVersion.cpp), the Code 128 row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODCode128Reader.cpp, core/src/oned/ODCode128Patterns.h,
core/src/Pattern.h, core/src/oned/ODRowReader.h), the PDF417 pure decoder
(core/src/pdf417/PDFReader.cpp, core/src/pdf417/PDFDetector.cpp,
core/src/pdf417/PDFCodewordDecoder.cpp,
core/src/pdf417/PDFScanningDecoder.cpp, core/src/pdf417/PDFBoundingBox.cpp,
core/src/pdf417/PDFDetectionResult.cpp, core/src/pdf417/PDFDetectionResultColumn.cpp,
core/src/pdf417/PDFBarcodeValue.cpp, core/src/pdf417/PDFDecoder.cpp,
core/src/pdf417/PDF417.h), the UPC/EAN row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODMultiUPCEANReader.cpp, core/src/oned/ODUPCEANCommon.cpp,
core/src/GTIN.h), the Code 39 row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODCode39Reader.cpp), the Code 93 row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODCode93Reader.cpp, core/src/oned/ODCode93Patterns.h), the Codabar row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODCodabarReader.cpp), the ITF row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODITFReader.cpp), the DataBar row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODDataBarReader.cpp, core/src/oned/ODDataBarLimitedReader.cpp,
core/src/oned/ODDataBarExpandedBitDecoder.cpp, core/src/oned/ODDataBarExpandedReader.cpp,
core/src/oned/ODDataBarCommon.cpp,
core/src/oned/ODDataBarCommon.h), the Aztec detector
(core/src/aztec/AZDetector.cpp, core/src/LocalGrid.cpp), the Aztec bit decoder
(core/src/aztec/AZDecoder.cpp), the MaxiCode decoder
(core/src/maxicode/MCReader.cpp, core/src/maxicode/MCDecoder.cpp,
core/src/maxicode/MCBitMatrixParser.cpp), the Telepen row decoder
(core/src/oned/ODTelepenReader.cpp), the DX Film Edge reader
(core/src/oned/ODDXFilmEdgeReader.cpp), the ECI byte-to-text conversion
(core/src/TextDecoder.cpp), the guess of the character set of text without an ECI
(GuessTextEncoding in core/src/Content.cpp), the geometry those files use, the matrix binarizer in core/src/HybridBinarizer.cpp,
the scanline histogram in core/src/GlobalHistogramBinarizer.cpp,
the luminance pyramid in core/src/ReadBarcode.cpp, and the Reed-Solomon decoder with erasures of
core/src/librscpp (decode.h, field.h, poly.h) with its fields in core/src/ReedSolomon.cpp.
Shift-JIS pairs 0x815C and 0x815F, and the user-area leads F0-F9, follow libzueci
(BSD-3-Clause, Copyright 2022 gitlost), which zxing-cpp embeds.
ISO/IEC 8859-10 and ISO/IEC 8859-14 are the standard repertoires; this JDK does not ship those charsets.
zxing-cpp is derived from the ZXing project.

This product also includes a Java port of parts of ZXing (https://github.com/zxing/zxing),
version 3.5.4: the thresholds of core/src/main/java/com/google/zxing/common/GlobalHistogramBinarizer.java
and HybridBinarizer.java, the Galois fields of the Reed-Solomon encoder
(common/reedsolomon/GenericGF.java, GenericGFPoly.java), and the QR Code
encoder (qrcode/encoder/Encoder.java, MatrixUtil.java, MaskUtil.java, ByteMatrix.java,
BlockPair.java, MinimalEncoder.java, qrcode/decoder/Mode.java and Version.java,
common/reedsolomon/ReedSolomonEncoder.java, common/ECIEncoderSet.java, and the part of
common/BitArray.java and common/CharacterSetECI.java it uses).
The linear writers port ZXing's core/src/main/java/com/google/zxing/oned/Code128Writer.java,
Code39Writer.java, Code93Writer.java, CodaBarWriter.java, ITFWriter.java, EAN13Writer.java,
EAN8Writer.java, UPCAWriter.java and UPCEWriter.java, with the pattern tables of their readers.
The Data Matrix writer ports datamatrix/DataMatrixWriter.java and the package datamatrix/encoder,
with common/MinimalECIInput.java and ECIInput.java; its minimal encoder takes 22 codewords for the
12x36 rectangle, where ZXing has 33, and writes the EDIFACT unlatch that ZXing leaves out.
The PDF417 writer ports pdf417/PDF417Writer.java and the package pdf417/encoder, and the Aztec
writer aztec/AztecWriter.java and the package aztec/encoder.
