The test corpus in datasets/artelab-medium-barcode-1d/ is the Arte-Lab Medium
Barcode 1D collection (Dataset1 with autofocus, Dataset2 without, 430 EAN-13
photographs). It is not part of the 22-sample scan benchmark.
Files in datasets/zxing-cpp-3.1.1/samples/ are the zxing-cpp 3.1.1
test/samples images and texts whose bytes are not already under
src/test/resources. They stay off the test classpath.

